<title>USA: NYSE UNAVAILABLES.</title>
<headline>NYSE UNAVAILABLES.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Thursday National Media Corp, Oxford Industries Inc and CNA Financial Corp were unavailable for news pending.</p>
<p>Corimon SACA and Compania Boliviana de Energia were also unavailable for after-hours trading, the exchange said.</p>
